  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the exam date for the posts of Scientific Assistant, Scientific Assistant (Special Selection), Accountant/Auditor, Law Assistant, Laboratory Assistant, Monitoring Assistant, Junior Engineer (Special Selection), and Junior Engineer in UP Pollution Control Board Recruitment 2026 on the official website of UPSSSC.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Applications for the UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Recruitment 2026 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">02 April 2026</span>, to <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">29 April 2026</span>. The written examination is going to be conducted on 29 June 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt. No. 02-Exam/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>02 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>29 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>29 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>06 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date&nbsp;:<b> 29 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available&nbsp;<b>: Before Exam</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Candidates : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates:<strong> Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 115 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant (Special Selection)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Accountant / Auditor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">22</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Legal&nbsp;Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Laboratory Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Monitoring Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">35</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer (Special Selection)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">29</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;Postgraduate degree in Zoology, Botany, Chemistry, Biochemistry, or Environmental Science&nbsp;from a recognized university. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card&nbsp;to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant (Special Selection)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;Postgraduate degree in Zoology, Botany, Chemistry, Biochemistry, or Environmental Science&nbsp;from a recognized university. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card&nbsp;to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Accountant / Auditor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;Bachelor’s degree in Commerce (B.Com) with Accountancy&nbsp;from a recognized university and&nbsp;at least one year of experience in accounting in a government or semi-government organization. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card&nbsp;to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Legal&nbsp;Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;Bachelor’s degree in Law (LLB)&nbsp;from a recognized university and&nbsp;at least three years of experience as an Advocate, Lawyer, Barrister, or Attorney. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card&nbsp;to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Laboratory Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have&nbsp;passed Intermediate (Class 12) in Science from the U.P. Board or an equivalent recognized board. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card&nbsp;to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Monitoring Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have&nbsp;passed Intermediate (Class 12) in Science from the U.P. Board or an equivalent recognized board. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card&nbsp;to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer (Special Selection)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;Diploma in Public Health, Civil, Chemical, or Environmental Engineering&nbsp;from a recognized institute. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card. For more details about the eligibility criteria, candidates should&nbsp;read the official notification carefully.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;Diploma in Public Health, Civil, Chemical, or Environmental Engineering&nbsp;from a recognized institute. Additionally, applicants must possess a&nbsp;valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card. For more details about the eligibility criteria, candidates should&nbsp;read the official notification carefully.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Login ID/Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also download their exam date from official site of the UPSSSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting (PET 2025 Score)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\"